     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>The ZOLLER portfolio offers you precise presetting and measuring machines, comprehensive hardware and software for tool management and solutions for the error-free transfer of tool data.</strong></p> <p>Economical milling processes require µm-accurate precision and high efficiency in terms of time and costs. Precision begins with measuring the many geometries of a cutting tool. For the best possible efficiency, tools must be readily available and tool data must be up-to-date at every step. With ZOLLER, all milling tool processes are a success.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
